Adds an interactive 'RSS feed' entry to the setup popup opening a small window
that collects a feed URL (+ optional title) and adds it under the synthetic
local Feeds account via CommsAccounts.createRssFeed, then re-arms WorkerFeedSync.

New files: FragmentDialogRss.java, res/layout/dialog_rss.xml.
Upstream touch-points: 2 hooks in FragmentSetup, 3 in ActivitySetup.
